Reference hindcast for issue #51 (validation folder): one year of spin-up from GLORYS, then the Tsubouchi year, with
the settings of the four-month NEMO run on NumericalEarth 0.9.4; and a twin starting 1 Sep 2005 without spin-up.
Before them:
- [time] build_only: build the model (which downloads every GLORYS day and JRA55 year of the dates), then stop at
  stop_time 0. config_download_hindcast_2004_2006.toml fetches everything both hindcasts need.
- A restart test: config_smoke_restart_a.toml (1–4 Sep, 100 km, the hindcasts' physics, daily checkpoints), _b.toml
  (restart from the latest checkpoint to 6 Sep), _ref.toml (1–6 Sep in one go); analysis/restart_check.jl compares
  them record by record. No run has restarted from a checkpoint before.
- [output] checkpoint_cleanup: Checkpointer(cleanup = true) keeps only the latest checkpoint (two years every 10 days
  would otherwise keep ~73 full states).
- [output] scorecard = false: the runner skips its scorecard step (a two-year scorecard would spend most of a day on
  GLORYS transports); the analyses are run by hand afterwards.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
